<title>USA: DigiMedia, National market software.</title>
<headline>DigiMedia, National market software.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DigiMedia USA Inc said on Monday it has a letter of intent from National Data Corp for the companies to jointly develop digital video disc programs.</p>
<p>DigiMedia said it expects to derive $1.5 million in profit from the venture, which includes state-of-the-art patient education software covering more than 30 dental procedures which both companies will market but DigiMedia will own.</p>
<p>DigiMedia creates and markets interactive multimedia coursework for health care, private security, mass transportation and education.</p>
